                "order": 0,
                "title": "The name is inserted directly",
                "prose": "The declared greeting contract accepts a string and returns a string; its body uses one template expression that inserts the supplied name directly rather than routing it through another formatter. Inference: With Ada as the supplied name, greeting yields Hello, Ada because the function places that name after its fixed Hello prefix; this example is inferred from the single interpolation expression.",
